  "instructions": [
    "heat butter in a large pot over medium heat, then add the onion, leek, and garlic, cooking until the vegetables are softened.",
    "add the potato and carrot to the pot, cooking for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "add the chicken broth and bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "add the kale to the pot and cook until the leaves are tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "stir in the mint and season the stew with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "serve hot, garnished with additional mint if desired."
